[{"title":"贺新郎 其八 追次玉林所赋溪楼燕集韵","author":"冯取洽","text":"二老交相访。\n正不妨、勃窣媻姗，舍车而杖。\n忆在蓉村新雨过，门外春流浩荡。\n中有个、列仙臞相。\n把酒论诗饶胜韵，更柳边、花底同心赏。\n临别句，几回唱。\n忽传风驭来溪上。\n遣儿曹、策马郊迎，老怀欣畅。\n争讶金华佳父子，飞下蓬莱昆阆。\n有四士、追随仙仗。\n我爱君如何次道，便令人、直欲倾家酿。\n歌妙曲，郑声放。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其三 次韵江定轩咏菊","author":"冯取洽","text":"句里思黄九。\n笑王郎、不奈寒芳，腰围如柳。\n得似江郎饶雅趣，时揽黄花诳口。\n吐妙语、与之争秀。\n闲绕珍丛吟不尽，尽风前、露下栾栾瘦。\n香自足，岂劳嗅。\n一尊问我能同否。\n叹双溪、冷落篱边，傲霜犹有。\n浩唱云笺金缕调，兴发小槽珠酒。\n待唤醒、早春梅友。\n独恨爱花人易老，漫一年，好景还依旧。\n东望处，立良久。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其五 次玉林见寿韵","author":"冯取洽","text":"那得身无事。\n问双溪老子，而今万缘空否。\n正使尘劳偿未了，毕竟难昏灵府。\n已笑唾、功名如土。\n五十九年风雨过，算非非、是是何须数。\n垂老也，信缘度。\n绿阴朱夏回清暑。\n叹病来、觞怯流霞，扇闲白羽。\n方念生初增感慨，谁寄乐章新语。\n知是我、花庵庵主。\n一别三年惟梦见，定何时、相对倾琼醑。\n惊世路，有豺虎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其六 次玉林感时韵","author":"冯取洽","text":"知彼须知此。\n问筹边、攻守规模，云何则是。\n景色愔愔犹日暮，壮士无由吐气。\n又安得、将如廉李。\n燕坐江沱甘自蹙，笑腐儒、枉楦朝家紫。\n用与舍，徒为耳。\n黄芦白苇迷千里。\n叹长淮、篱落空疏，仅馀残垒。\n读父兵书宁足恃，击楫谁盟江水。\n有识者、知其庸矣。\n多少英雄沈草野，岂堂堂、吾国无君子。\n起诸葛，总戎事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 其一 寿张宜轩","author":"冯取洽","text":"九日明朝是。\n问宜轩何事，今朝众宾交至。\n长记每年八月八，曾庆饮仙出世。\n直推到、于今何意。\n要待千崖秋气爽，向东篱、试探花开未。\n挝急鼓，舞长袂。\n主人臭味花相似。\n笑争春、红紫低昂，转头扫地。\n独占西风摇落候，旋屑黄金点缀。\n做得个、秋花元帅。\n旧说东阳流菊水，饮之者、寿过百馀岁。\n泛此酒，劝公醉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿","author":"冯取洽","text":"叹刘郎、那回轻别，霏霏三落红雨。\n玄都观里应遗恨，一抹断烟残缕。\n愁望处。\n想雾暗云深，忘却来时路。\n新花旧主。\n记刻羽流商，裁红剪翠，山径日将暮。\n空枝上，时有幽禽对语。\n声声如问来否。\n人生行乐须闻健，衰老念谁免此。\n吾所与。\n在溪上深深，锦绣千花坞。\n何时定去。\n但对酒思君，呼儿为我，频唱小桃句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 和玉林韵","author":"冯取洽","text":"秋到双溪溪上树。\n叶叶凉声，未省来何许。\n尽拓溪楼窗与户。\n倚阑清夜窥河鼓。\n那得吟朋同此住。\n独对秋芳，欲寄花无处。\n杖履相从曾有语。\n未来先自愁君去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小池","author":"冯坦","text":"岩上层层叠翠苔，小池巧凿近岩隈。\n就岩引得清泉满，便有前山月入来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏云","author":"冯坦","text":"山腰一抹云，云起知何处。\n争渡小桥寻，天风又吹去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其一","author":"冯坦","text":"夜静山寒渐透衣，旋煨松火拥炉围。\n忽听竹外篱门响，知是小童买酒归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其二","author":"冯坦","text":"向晚闲行步夕阳，归来松径已昏黄。\n隔林风度钟声细，认得庵中炷夜香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其三","author":"冯坦","text":"莫道经霜不见花，小春风景属山家。\n满山红叶斜阳映，却似桃源一片霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桐庐暑夜","author":"冯坦","text":"中流有行舟，似亦得清致。\n只恐乘舟人，未识月中意。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸬鹚源樵歌","author":"冯坦","text":"绮罗巷陌总成尘，那识担柴老买臣。\n自笑卖柴元似旧，买柴却换旧时人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟陶","author":"冯坦","text":"茅檐入幽径，风雨聊可栖。\n喜无车马喧，而有耒耜随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏云","author":"冯坦","text":"石何有于云，云乃生于石。\n拂石讯云踪，苔深无处觅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢虞司户钟乳粉","author":"冯坦","text":"仙家仙药不易得，颇为鬼神所爱惜。\n道人入山因采出，轻如鹅管如蝉翼。\n多君用心穷药谱，能辨始兴最良处。\n合入梁公药笼贮，嗟乎，嗟乎，世上伏苓多老芋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"冯坦","text":"终日无人到，隔林惟鸟啼。\n雀舌收先雨，猫头掘带泥。\n因听敲竹雨，四壁半生苔。\n飘风惊日月，落叶满乾坤。\n井在丹谁练，碑残墨欲枯。\n多应河畔骨，便是屋中人。\n无钱难得酒，有菊自开花。\n鸥趁湍流下，鱼藏石罅间。\n郡乘纪春申，山因号曰君。\n非关前哲真难及，自是今人不肯高。\n道人已是九分清，双鹤飞来凑十分。\n万里远来寻屋住，四边先问有梅无。\n古庙荧荧多鬼火，荒村寂寂少人烟。\n可邻门外新归燕，不见堂前旧主人。\n店荒任客来争席，郊迥无人可问程。\n每向宋清求善药，闲从詹尹卜新年。\n灯影照残孤枕梦，雨声滴碎两年心。\n兴亡有数从千古，寒暑无情又一年。\n问天底是资身策，度日应收卖卜钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"全州南城","author":"冯岵","text":"全州城南何壮观，石崖为趾江为濠。\n凌落渡江骑马去，空濛瘴雾漫绨袍。\n逦迤过滩水，小艇浮桐槽。\n半渡急雨雪，舟师失飞篙。\n雨飞山路水如注，石齿荦确森戈刀。\n马蹄转侧不得过，有力如虎空皮毛。\n地穷路尽处，横绝青山高。\n褰衣扶杖蹑天险，十步九顾愁猿猱。\n长沙顿伏几百折，背膂菌蠢盘鲸鳌。\n马瘦人力倦，野阔风怒号。\n薄暮投宿驱湿厉，析薪爨鼎烧村醪。\n一杯酸涩不可咽，平原督邮羞儿曹。\n我行湖湘历八郡，政欲阅实宁辞劳。\n才疏病懒事多废，南山何日接蓬蒿。\n清风明月共三友，山猿野鹤来二豪。\n一江春水澄葡萄，芦花万顷眠渔舠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃源图","author":"冯信可","text":"桃源东回溪转长，桃花开时春日光。\n幽禽出树乱红落，游鱼吹花流水香。\n山人正住溪之浒，屋角花开自成坞。\n寻源未许武陵人，隐者但作桃花主。\n拄杖穿花来水头，禽鱼亦解识风流。\n往来况有樵云叟，何惜衔杯同唱酬。\n一尊如出桃花色，花落尊中已无迹。\n醉乡泠泠白日闲，黄尘滚滚青山隔。\n明年此日桃花开，何人净扫溪阴苔。\n我亦天台约刘阮，春风一棹酒船来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庵","author":"冯脩之","text":"孤庵半掩门，竹外见前村。\n地僻山容静，天阴日色昏。\n风琴鸣木杪，水乐漱云根。\n苍壁题诗处，淋漓醉墨痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题徐氏金湖书院","author":"冯拯","text":"古艾地多胜，修宁景最幽。\n溪声常到枕，山色正含秋。\n树密苔封径，庭虚月满楼。\n清辉光累世，高义藉名流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"冯显","text":"甲子循环幸一终。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳熙壬寅沿檄游洞天","author":"冯钢","text":"洞府深沈别有天，翚飞楼阁耸晴烟。\n诗传玉局惊凡目，丹就金炉记昔年。\n翠涌千波横绝壁，风吹万籁入飞泉。\n他时待我功成后，卜室青山绝世缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝融峰","author":"冯浚","text":"手执筇敲结佩刀，直趋危顶一峰豪。\n回头朝市声声远，接武烟霞步步高。\n天上召雷池水涨，人间祷雨穴风号。\n九千七百三十丈，翠压江湖几点涛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"冯浩","text":"前岁虎符才罢府，此时龙节复行台。\n江湖远地虽劳力，大紫中楹正择才。\n召伯甘棠歌旧治，并州竹马喜重来。\n莫将华发嗟寒素，会见青云道路开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21485,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题招题院静照堂","author":"冯浩","text":"宝坊新构断尘飞，宴坐朝朝内外宜。\n一自觉来无相见，久忘言后少人知。\n天中月满云收夜，海底珠明浪静时。\n顿向此间超十地，愿将安定證群疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21486,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"众乐亭","author":"冯浩","text":"尝闻众乐亭，未窥众乐景。\n今蒙贶新诗，若得暂观省。\n万象盈纸来，孤风随笔骋。\n丹青惭近功，造化与遥领。\n因识主人怀，殆非郡侯政。\n所寄嬉游中，期欢众庶竞。\n无俾一夫愁，将和四时盛。\n此而推是心，况乎持大柄。\n青山绿水佳，百草千花胜。\n吾将因宦游，异日细谣咏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21487,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题义门胡氏华林书院","author":"冯起","text":"华林仙野近南昌，闻说幽奇景异常。\n竹翠松寒笼药圃，水清山秀绕书堂。\n词登科第名尤振，恩表门闾道愈光。\n我恨方为簪组累，莫同吟啸白云房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21488,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"冯戴","text":"荆轲一去不复返，易水东流无尽期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21489,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南山留题","author":"冯晦","text":"南山之景幽且清，台亭上下知几层。\n王吴妙手写不得，若非造物其谁能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21490,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆乡歌四首 其四","author":"冯梦得","text":"塞北寒气逼，对火拥氍毹。\n犹忆侬家里，蓬头两夹襦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21491,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆乡歌四首 其三","author":"冯梦得","text":"塞上秋始肃，野草叶叶黄。\n侬家有菊花，灼灼不忧霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21492,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆乡歌四首 其二","author":"冯梦得","text":"炎夏天颇热，侬门对溪住。\n摇荡采莲舟，深处疑风露。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21493,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆乡歌四首 其一","author":"冯梦得","text":"侬是剑南人，惯识故乡好。\n绿叶接红花，辉映绥安道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋新繁周表权如诏亭","author":"冯彭年","text":"先生教子作通儒，诗礼亲闱伯鲤趋。\n亭构义方名昔著，诏颁封爵语今符。\n荣因慈孝家声振，默契丝纶宠数殊。\n善庆谁能肩懿躅，贤哉奋达美相须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏归亭","author":"冯椅","text":"弓转寒溪月一湾，下临虎豹踞斓斑。\n林烟开处飞层阁，云市穷头护远山。\n衿佩光阴弦诵里，舟梁人物画图间。\n红尘堆案那能到，只有渔舟自往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21496,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自咏","author":"冯楫","text":"公事之馀喜坐禅，少曾将胁到床眠。\n虽然现出宰官相，长老之名四海传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21497,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝谕赈济诗","author":"冯楫","text":"我朝未第日，乡间逢岁饥。\n两率闾里人，相共行赈济。\n饥民仅得食，免困饿而毙。\n及我登第后，被罪归田里。\n寻复拜召命，迤逦治行计。\n忽见道途间，小儿有遗弃。\n复自劝乡邦，割己用施惠。\n日饭八千人，八旬乃休止。\n于时已麦熟，粮食相接济。\n我始趋行朝，蒙恩长宗寺。\n初本不望报，人以为能事。\n利司具切奏，还官不容避。\n今年又少歉，我适帅泸水。\n无户备饭食，所济俱用米。\n聊舍三百斛，十中活一二。\n又以一千石，减价平行市。\n每石减十钱，庶几无涌贵。\n更有不熟处，资简潼川类。\n计用减价粜，所祈均获济。\n我非财有馀，但悯民不易。\n一时所施行，乐为之识记。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21498,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"施经偈","author":"冯楫","text":"我赋耽痂癖，有财贮空虚。\n不作子孙计，不为车马速。\n不充玩好用，不买声色娱。\n置锥无南亩，片瓦无屋庐。\n所得月俸给，唯将赎梵书。\n万里遣迎介，崎岖涉长途。\n奉安大刹中，开示诸迷徒。\n庶几披阅者，咸得入无馀。\n古佛为半偈，尚乃舍生躯。\n我今以财施，痛楚不侵肤。\n以我较古佛，苦乐万倍殊。\n所以不惜财，非是禀性愚。\n借问借财人，终日较锱铢。\n无常忽地到，宁免生死无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21499,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终颂","author":"冯楫","text":"初三十一，中九下七。\n老人言尽，龟哥眼赤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21500,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题枯髅图","author":"冯楫","text":"形骸在此，其人何在。\n乃知一灵，不属皮袋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21501,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如梦令 题龙脊石","author":"冯熔","text":"素养浩然之气，铁石心肠谁拟。\n蒿目县前江，不逐队鱼游戏。\n藏器。\n藏器。\n只等时乘奋起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21502,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷 其一","author":"冯端荣","text":"缲得春蚕不值钱，几时南亩解丰年。\n小臣无计纾民力，稽首虚皇一炷烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21503,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷 其二","author":"冯端荣","text":"花满晴烟树满云，我来宁是学仙人。\n愿将九曲溪头水，散作年年百里春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21504,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登齐山","author":"冯袖然","text":"万山森玉寒如削，一骑奔尘去欲飞。\n路阔并鞍同笑语，酒酣执手话依违。\n英名他日垂青史，好语今朝纪翠微。\n三月钱塘江上道，莫歌金缕易忘归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21505,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题慈溪庆安寺古松","author":"冯輗","text":"寒松一干老苍苍，古寺门前岁月长。\n匠伯偶图舟楫利，禅翁方患斧斤伤。\n得全此日同齐栎，勿剪他年比召棠。\n可但与君期久远，相将俱列大夫行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21506,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岩砻洞留题","author":"包伯驺","text":"巍然造化功，斡擘成岩豅。\n石顶滴清沥，洞深飕细风。\n我来畏暑间，憩此清泠中。\n缅怀二老调，逸思更无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21507,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翻经台白莲池","author":"包信","text":"野蔓高台下，前朝记不诬。\n金文翻古偈，汉字变胡书。\n綵线风飘断，缃帘火烬馀。\n破云开白日，穿水照芙蕖。\n科斗频更改，庵园几遍锄。\n真门兼逸韵，两欲慕相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21508,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月道中效赵章泉体四首 其四","author":"包恢","text":"耕者劳筋苦骨馀，富家仓廪始多储。\n及饥合发方牢闭，不识私家得食诸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21509,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月道中效赵章泉体四首 其三","author":"包恢","text":"踯躅红花何实用，牡丹名品只虚奇。\n看今春晚方艰食，何似充饥有蕨萁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21510,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月道中效赵章泉体四首 其二","author":"包恢","text":"苦雨花无色与香，送春叶漫绿和黄。\n蚕声百鸟飞鸣少，遽听催归叫夜长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21511,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月道中效赵章泉体四首 其一","author":"包恢","text":"鸣蛙一部不虚鸣，知为农人奏乐声。\n一岁勤劳方此始，侑他南亩馌时情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21512,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其四","author":"包恢","text":"木落叶栖风，阵阵着肌体。\n应忆故园花，欲开为寒止。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21513,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其三","author":"包恢","text":"远山没云烟，不辨形与色。\n茫如天下垂，前路不可得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21514,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其二","author":"包恢","text":"浓烟笼远岫，望眼如昏花。\n欲暮还欲雨，行人始离家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21515,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其一","author":"包恢","text":"春意藏山川，如童蒙未发。\n一朝兴勃然，触处争英杰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其六","author":"包恢","text":"出门逢行人，经纬真如织。\n织成幅员长，皆是名利力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金溪道中六首 其五","author":"包恢","text":"路傍逢古梅，元是旧相识。\n花萼知几多，萼萼相顾惜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成五首 其五","author":"包恢","text":"柔条嫩叶春新媚，劲干刚枝岁久磨。\n忺厌人情每相反，欲支大厦问凭何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21519,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成五首 其四","author":"包恢","text":"南风正起北风微，谁谓秋高尚马肥。\n但愿金飙摧落木，和根亦仆拟何归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21520,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成五首 其三","author":"包恢","text":"农家命脉寄田亩，可但稻粱枯与荣。\n造化何许须多力，须臾活几万苍生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21521,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成五首 其二","author":"包恢","text":"添我凉飙伴我閒，今年新竹未云悭。\n翻嫌户外三两个，遮断东来半好山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21522,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成五首 其一","author":"包恢","text":"六月浑如九月清，霁天月色冷幽屏。\n出门聊寄双远目，二十四凹峰转青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21523,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]